msgid ""
"Only one player can win the game. If the remaining players are allies, the "
"game continues until only one remains."
msgstr "只有一個玩家能在這場遊戲中獲勝；若剩下的玩家都是盟友，遊戲仍要繼續，直到只剩下一個玩家為止。"

