"When hosting, pause the game if observers are lagging more than this many "
"turns. If set to -1, observers are ignored."
msgstr "主持時，如果觀察者的延遲時間超過這邊多少回合，則暫停遊戲。如果設為 -1，觀察者將被忽略。"

